    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. it just feels weird how something so small can be so aggressive and totally out of control if one little thing goes wrong. is there any specific way to handle it so it doesn't catch me off guard? like, what's the best way to contain it if it starts acting up while i'm opening the case?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
